    "research": {
      "notes": "**Window: 2026-09-28 to 2026-10-28. I found nothing material in the window for topics 1, 3 and 4.**\n\n**1. Guidance**\n- No guidance change, pre-announcement or reiteration found in the window.\n- Context, before the window: Rubrik reported Q2 FY27 on 2026-08-27. Results beat all guided metrics and it raised all FY27 guided metrics. — 2026-08-27 — https://www.nasdaq.com/press-release/rubrik-reports-second-quarter-fiscal-year-2027-financial-results-2026-08-27\n- Q3 FY27 revenue guidance is $429–431M. — 2026-08-27 — https://www.rubrik.com/company/newsroom/press-releases/26/rubrik-reports-second-quarter-fiscal-year-2027-financial-results\n- FY27 guidance is subscription ARR $1,880–1,885M, revenue $1,685–1,693M and non-GAAP EPS $0.47–0.53. — 2026-08-27 — https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/RBRK/8-k-rubrik-inc-reports-material-event-8842c5be7e05.html\n- I did not find the Q3 earnings date.\n\n**2. Analyst actions**\n- Wedbush raised its price target to $150 from $120 and kept Outperform. — 2026-10-26 — https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/analyst-rubrik-nyse-rbrk-stock-price-expected-to-rise-wedbush-analyst-says-2026-10-26/\n- Wedbush also added Rubrik to its Best Ideas List. — 2026-10-26 — https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/why-did-cart-rbrk-rrc-030736953.html\n- MarketBeat shows a consensus target of $116.67, with 29 Buy ratings and 1 Sell. — 2026-10-26 — https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/analyst-rubrik-nyse-rbrk-stock-price-expected-to-rise-wedbush-analyst-says-2026-10-26/\n- A TradingKey piece says several brokerages raised targets or initiated coverage around 2026-10-23. It names no firms, so I could not verify it. — 2026-10-23 — https://www.tradingkey.com/news/market-movers/262236472-market-movers-rbrk-20261023\n- Baird's raise to $139 from $130 falls just outside the window. — 2026-09-22 per TipRanks, 2026-09-23 per Ticker Nerd, 2026-09-24 per Yahoo — https://www.cnn.com/markets/stocks/RBRK ; https://tickernerd.com/stock/rbrk-forecast/ ; https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RBRK/analyst-insights/\n- Other target raises listed on aggregators are outside the window or undated.\n\n**3. Litigation and regulation**\n- No new lawsuits, investigations, fines or regulatory actions found in the window.\n- The only items that came up were old: Commvault's 2020 patent suit and a 2024-reported DOJ probe of a former employee. Neither is current news. — 2020-04-21 — https://www.commvault.com/news/commvault-initiates-patent-infringement-litigation-against-cohesity-and-rubrik\n\n**4. Customer concentration**\n- No named customer wins, losses or contract changes found in the window.\n- Latest data I found is older. At Q4 FY26, 2,805 customers with $100K+ subscription ARR generated 87% of subscription ARR. — 2026-03-12 — https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/rubrik-rbrk-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/\n\n**5. Insider activity**\n- CTO and director Arvind Nithrakashyap sold 38,460 Class A shares on 2026-10-05 to 2026-10-07 under a 10b5-1 plan adopted 2025-10-15. He also converted 28,141 Class B shares to Class A. — 2026-10-05 — https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/RBRK/form-4-rubrik-inc-insider-trading-activity-97e0d55e2350.html\n- The Form 4 shows sales at about $121–128 per share. — 2026-10-05 — https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001943896/000201914326000023/form4-10072026_101053.xml\n- A Form 4 filed 2026-10-02 reports 10b5-1 sales at about $114–117 per share, with a plan adopted 2025-10-06. The filer appears to be a co-trustee of the John and Sandra Thompson Trust. — transaction date not visible in the excerpt I retrieved (the filing date is 2026-10-02) — https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001943896/000120743326000022/form4-10022026_091056.xml\n- MarketBeat-derived data says insiders sold 139,583 shares worth $13.5M over the last quarter. That figure is not tied to specific dates. — date unknown — https://defenseworld.net/2026/10/22/rubrik-inc-rbrk-stock-diversify-advisory-services-llc-reduces-position.html\n- No insider purchases found.\n\n**6. Product and competitive news**\n- Rubrik expanded Project Hourglass with Rubrik Code Guardian, powered by Anthropic's Claude. — 2026-10-09 per the Business Wire dateline (Stock Titan lists it 2026-10-08, 8:30 PM) — https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/rbrk/\n- Rubrik MCP is in private preview, with general availability targeted for October 2026. — 2026-10-08 — https://www.stocktitan.net/news/RBRK/\n- RBRK hit a 52-week high on 2026-10-26, up about 3% that day. — 2026-10-26 — https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/why-did-cart-rbrk-rrc-030736953.html\n- No competitor, pricing or share-shift news found in the window.",
